# --- Live LLM configuration ------------------------------------------------------
# TRINETRA is LIVE BY DEFAULT in the browser: it calls the key-holding Cloudflare Worker
# (infra/trinetra-llm → https://trinetra-llm.sampoornacrm.workers.dev), which holds
# NVIDIA_API_KEY server-side. The browser never sees a key — nothing to configure here
# for normal use. Node (npm run check) is always offline/deterministic.
#
# Overrides (copy to .env.local — gitignored — if you need them):
# VITE_AI_LIVE=0                      # kill switch: force the offline deterministic stand-ins
# VITE_AI_ENDPOINT=                   # point at a different OpenAI-compatible endpoint
#
# The Worker's key is set OUTSIDE this repo, never in code or env files:
#   npx wrangler secret put NVIDIA_API_KEY --name trinetra-llm
#   npx wrangler secret put NVIDIA_MODEL  --name trinetra-llm   # optional override
#
# Build-time cache regeneration (scripts/generate-llm-cache.mjs) reads NVIDIA_API_KEY /
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / AWS_* from the shell environment — also never from this file.
